# Theme & widgets

- Use `AppColors`, `AppSpacing`, `AppTypography`, and `Theme.of(context)` — no raw hex or ad-hoc TextStyles in features.
- Reuse `AppButton`, `AppTextField`, `AppScaffold`, `AppPage`, `AppEmptyState`, `AppLoading`, `AppErrorView` before creating new primitives.
- Responsive: `AppBreakpoints` + `ResponsiveLayout`; never assume phone width.
- Cards only when the container aids interaction/understanding.
